    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/89af0d234a289be090516605561ffd75.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a variety of dynamic tracks, each designed to challenge your precision, reflexes, and strategy. With a <strong>bold and striking art style crafted by ICONIC GARAGE</strong>, every race feels like a visual spectacle\u2014where speed meets style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/0fac350af9d07be27d6a468db07a0a68.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Time Attack</strong> \u2013 Beat the clock and set record-breaking lap times.<br>\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Ghost Races</strong> \u2013 Challenge your own best times or race against ghost opponents to fine-tune your skills.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2013 Take the competition online and race against real players in thrilling, skill-based matchups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/cc2bee68525e12d3e6e78ba0e0a0d5f3.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize. Tune. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your rules! Fine-tune your vehicle\u2019s settings to match your racing style and the demands of each track. Whether it\u2019s adjusting suspension for off-road grip, optimizing aerodynamics for high-speed circuits, or tweaking handling for tight corners, every setting can be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/5728f566ed2ee9b6216c086bdfe13231.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse lineup of cars, each designed for different terrains and racing disciplines. Master every map, discover hidden achievements, and prove you have what it takes to be the fastest on the road!<br><br>Makes good 'ol racing great again! CARCADE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/34f7006023554be17c1a44e316ddda09.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/89af0d234a289be090516605561ffd75.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a variety of dynamic tracks, each designed to challenge your precision, reflexes, and strategy. With a <strong>bold and striking art style crafted by ICONIC GARAGE</strong>, every race feels like a visual spectacle\u2014where speed meets style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/0fac350af9d07be27d6a468db07a0a68.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Time Attack</strong> \u2013 Beat the clock and set record-breaking lap times.<br>\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Ghost Races</strong> \u2013 Challenge your own best times or race against ghost opponents to fine-tune your skills.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2013 Take the competition online and race against real players in thrilling, skill-based matchups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/cc2bee68525e12d3e6e78ba0e0a0d5f3.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize. Tune. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your rules! Fine-tune your vehicle\u2019s settings to match your racing style and the demands of each track. Whether it\u2019s adjusting suspension for off-road grip, optimizing aerodynamics for high-speed circuits, or tweaking handling for tight corners, every setting can be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/5728f566ed2ee9b6216c086bdfe13231.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse lineup of cars, each designed for different terrains and racing disciplines. Master every map, discover hidden achievements, and prove you have what it takes to be the fastest on the road!<br><br>Makes good 'ol racing great again! CARCADE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515160/extras/34f7006023554be17c1a44e316ddda09.avif?t=1739623346\" width=624 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "CARCADE is a fast-paced racing game with a bold art style by ICONIC GARAGE. Compete in time trials, race against ghost opponents, AI, or real players. Tune your car for different terrains, master hidden mechanics, and unlock secret achievements. Speed, strategy, and skill will define your victory!",
